## Capacity Thresholds

### Alert Thresholds

| Resource | Warning | Critical | Action |
|----------|---------|----------|--------|
| CPU | 70% | 85% | Scale out |
| Memory | 75% | 90% | Scale out |
| Disk | 70% | 85% | Expand/archive |
| Database IOPS | 60% | 80% | Upgrade instance |
| Network | 70% | 85% | Add bandwidth |

### Scaling Triggers

| Trigger | Condition | Action |
|---------|-----------|--------|
| CPU sustained | >70% for 5 min | Add nodes |
| Memory pressure | >75% for 5 min | Add nodes |
| Request queue | >1000 | Add replicas |
| Database lag | >100ms | Add readers |
| Error rate | >0.1% | Investigate |

